{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A tribute to the old-school cRPG grind, BBS MUDs of the 1990s and early MMORPGs.\u00a0 Developed by a solo novice developer, Landonia is an old-school single-player, turn-based RPG that includes possibilities of parties upto 16 player-characters, treasures, grinding, questing, and classic cRPG play.\u00a0 \u00a0There are numerous factions that can be allied with or fought against, and NPCs will battle each other if the circumstances arise.\u00a0 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Game has a story-mode and separate arena battle-royale mode:</u></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upto 16 player characters that you create can be used interchangeably in either mode. Items, gold, and experience carry over from each mode.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Game has two separate modes of combat:</u></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(Default) ARPG style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control 1 player in continuous mode, with (upto-15) party members supporting you automatically based upon your party settings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classic Turn-Based.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control every player when it is their turn to move. It will automatically switch to the party member whose turn it is.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Tutorial Completed","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3394040/b52e7810ee73af66ca6f400a362745c94021d1cd.jpg"},{"name":"PRESS_X","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3394040/2984ea5531c67fb8964a0ad693a6e6fb76ba21e8.jpg"},{"name":"Lead a group","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3394040/97862e7aa10f108bfb3c542e19639b6cb5bd6c7c.jpg"},{"name":"Mini