ool single-player, turn-based RPG that includes possibilities of parties upto 16 player-characters, treasures, grinding, questing, and classic cRPG play.\u00a0 \u00a0There are numerous factions that can be allied with or fought against, and NPCs will battle each other if the circumstances arise.\u00a0 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Game has a story-mode and separate arena battle-royale mode:</u></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upto 16 player characters that you create can be used interchangeably in either mode. Items, gold, and experience carry over from each mode.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Game has two separate modes of combat:</u></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(Default) ARPG style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control 1 player in continuous mode, with (upto-15) party members supporting you automatically based upon your party settings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classic Turn-Based.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control every player when it is their turn to move. It will automatically switch to the party member whose turn it is.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["ocanaday"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3394040/header.jpg?t=1765924243","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Landonia copyright 2025","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3394040/151035589/415c54a7cd66d05b3ff83e027852e92413dbc09f/1750846851/dash_av1.mpd?t=1749162412","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3394040/151035589/415c54a7cd66d05b3ff83e027852e92413dbc09f/1750846